sequenceDiagram
  actor Captain
  participant App as Captain app
  participant API as Sync API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant R2

  Captain->>App: Download assigned trip
  App->>API: Request bundle with device identity
  API->>DB: Authorize assignment and build version manifest
  API->>R2: Store or retrieve encrypted bundle parts
  API-->>App: Manifest, signed parts, hashes, expiry
  App->>App: Download, verify hashes, decrypt into SQLCipher
  App-->>Captain: Offline ready only when every required part verifies
